WEBVTT

00:04.130 --> 00:07.210
Whoa! So this is Omui!

00:07.380 --> 00:08.500
Wow!

00:08.500 --> 00:09.330
Look at that!

00:09.330 --> 00:10.670
Now this feels like an isekai!

00:11.580 --> 00:12.630
It's wonderful!

00:17.790 --> 00:20.130
This town seems so fun and alive!

00:20.380 --> 00:22.080
Yeah, I guess.

00:22.380 --> 00:24.250
Not really a place for a loner...

00:24.540 --> 00:26.540
Oh! A clothes store!

00:26.540 --> 00:28.250
This place has lots of trinkets!

00:28.460 --> 00:29.500
They're so cute!

00:29.500 --> 00:30.420
I wanna get a look!

00:30.420 --> 00:31.130
Let's go!

00:31.130 --> 00:31.960
I'm coming, too!

00:32.080 --> 00:35.670
C'mon, girls! We still have stuff to do!

00:37.830 --> 00:41.750
I managed to see the girls from class safely to town.

00:42.960 --> 00:45.040
That should be the last they'll need of me.

02:21.750 --> 02:25.040
<b>LIFE IN TOWN</b>

02:21.960 --> 02:23.750
The buildings look like cupcakes!

02:23.920 --> 02:25.830
Think they're edible?

02:27.330 --> 02:28.790
They're not!

02:28.790 --> 02:31.170
Sheesh! Haruka, a little help here?

02:34.000 --> 02:37.630
I get this is a weight off your shoulders,
but you're relaxing TOO much!

02:39.790 --> 02:41.960
Grr! That's it!

02:45.250 --> 02:47.580
Yup. She's got them well trained.

02:48.080 --> 02:50.710
Seems like she can handle them from now on.

02:51.330 --> 02:54.290
Let me brief you on our plans from here.

02:54.670 --> 02:56.790
First we'll all head to the Adventurers Guild.

02:57.210 --> 02:59.710
<b>EXCHANGE</b>

02:57.330 --> 02:59.790
There we'll sell off everything we've gathered so far.

02:59.880 --> 03:01.960
<b>REGISTER</b>

02:59.960 --> 03:01.920
Then register with the Adventurers Guild.

03:02.080 --> 03:06.960
<b>GOODNIGHT</b>

03:02.290 --> 03:04.330
After that we'll all head to an inn!

03:04.330 --> 03:06.960
Yay! Finally some beds again!

03:06.960 --> 03:10.170
We can ask around about
Oda and the others while we're at it.

03:10.170 --> 03:12.960
Hold up! Are they just some side errand for you?!

03:13.250 --> 03:16.330
Sorry, I didn't mean it like that.

03:17.000 --> 03:19.580
Right, bet you're worried sick about 'em.

03:19.580 --> 03:22.880
Y-yeah right. Why would I be?

03:26.210 --> 03:28.420
So this is the Adventurers Guild...

03:32.330 --> 03:33.040
What's with them?

03:33.040 --> 03:34.170
Newbies?

03:34.170 --> 03:36.170
Quite the group, though...

03:36.710 --> 03:38.380
It's just a kid and some girls.

03:38.710 --> 03:40.420
Yikes!

03:40.420 --> 03:41.290
Kid!

03:42.460 --> 03:44.080
The Guild Boss wants you.

03:45.790 --> 03:47.540
I-I'll go see what's up.

03:48.290 --> 03:51.540
You all go ahead and get registered.

03:52.210 --> 03:54.250
R-right. Sure.

04:04.790 --> 04:07.420
E-everyone here looks like bad news!

04:13.710 --> 04:15.790
So you're Haruka?

04:16.460 --> 04:18.500
Y-yessir...

04:21.170 --> 04:24.420
As Guild Boss I figured you should hear this from me...

04:25.750 --> 04:28.460
Thanks for saving Ofter's party!

04:30.750 --> 04:31.500
Huh?

04:31.790 --> 04:34.540
Am I here for a letter of commendation?

04:36.330 --> 04:40.000
Whew. I thought I was in trouble.

04:40.920 --> 04:41.580
Hmm?

04:43.420 --> 04:45.500
That must be where you sell magic crystals.

04:46.670 --> 04:48.960
I'd like to sell my magic crystals!

04:48.960 --> 04:50.540
Very well!

04:50.540 --> 04:54.210
We'll appraise them here and inform you of their worth.

04:54.420 --> 04:58.080
Okay... Where do I put 'em?

04:58.500 --> 05:00.580
Huh? On the counter here.

05:01.210 --> 05:02.670
Okay! You asked for it.

05:04.380 --> 05:06.960
W-w-we can't appraise this many!

05:07.170 --> 05:10.630
What? You want more? I can go get some.

05:10.630 --> 05:13.670
Who do you think you are, kid? Huh?!

05:13.670 --> 05:15.330
Please wait until tomorrow.

05:15.540 --> 05:17.580
I-it's no big deal...

05:18.380 --> 05:19.580
Haruka!

05:20.580 --> 05:22.920
We're all registered as adventurers!

05:25.880 --> 05:28.040
Never thought all the girlies would.

05:28.250 --> 05:31.000
They're all at least level 30.

05:32.250 --> 05:33.920
I was so nervous.

05:33.920 --> 05:35.750
I'm glad we all got registered.

05:36.040 --> 05:37.880
Now we're real adventurers!

05:38.330 --> 05:44.130
They all leveled up a bunch on the way,
and had OP skills from the white room from the start.

05:45.830 --> 05:47.040
Lookie here.

05:47.040 --> 05:48.170
You sure are somethin'.

05:48.330 --> 05:50.330
I knew the moment I saw ya!

05:51.080 --> 05:54.380
All the old dudes have done a hard about-face!

05:55.170 --> 05:57.460
C'mon, now it's your turn!

05:58.790 --> 06:00.790
I'm finally going to be an adventurer.

06:02.170 --> 06:04.250
Farewell, life as a NEET!

06:04.710 --> 06:06.920
I'd like to register, please!

06:09.420 --> 06:15.080
Ofter. Gatek... he's going to be an incredible adventurer.

06:15.420 --> 06:17.210
Yeah, you think?

06:17.380 --> 06:24.380
Oh yes. None of us would be here today
if it weren't for him.

06:28.000 --> 06:29.290
My apologies...

06:29.790 --> 06:34.000
But you must be at least level 10 in order to register.

06:41.830 --> 06:43.750
C-can't you make an exception?!

06:43.750 --> 06:44.710
Absolutely not.

06:45.080 --> 06:47.830
Adventurers must be at least level 10.

06:47.830 --> 06:50.130
They must also be in a party.

06:51.880 --> 06:55.790
Solo you'll be considered a beginner at level 20.

06:55.790 --> 06:59.540
And only earn any credibility
once you've reached level 30.

07:00.000 --> 07:01.960
Level 20 is too far away...

07:02.290 --> 07:05.250
And my Loner skill means I can't even form a party...

07:05.830 --> 07:08.920
I'm stuck as a NEET forever...

07:12.000 --> 07:13.170
Haruka...

07:13.420 --> 07:14.540
Kid...

07:15.630 --> 07:17.040
You can't make this stuff up!

07:17.500 --> 07:23.750
All right. If Haruka is down and out, then it's
my responsibility to see everyone safe to our lodging.

07:32.170 --> 07:33.880
Pick up your feet as you walk.

07:36.130 --> 07:40.080
We're here! The guild made arrangements here for us!

07:46.250 --> 07:50.330
Welcome! The guild said we should expect you!

07:52.000 --> 07:54.670
I-is this a love hotel?!

07:54.670 --> 07:56.250
That shouldn't even be a question!

07:58.920 --> 08:00.130
Wow!

08:00.130 --> 08:01.080
It's beautiful!

08:01.170 --> 08:02.290
G'night!

08:02.290 --> 08:03.750
See ya tomorrow!

08:04.130 --> 08:05.710
It's pretty normal inside.

08:14.630 --> 08:18.460
Beds are nice and all, but I miss the woods.

08:21.830 --> 08:24.750
Where are Oda and his herd now?

08:31.380 --> 08:33.080
<b>DAY 19</b>

08:31.750 --> 08:33.040
There's bread!

08:33.290 --> 08:34.630
It's so hard...

08:35.000 --> 08:39.080
Girls! This town is supposed to be pretty safe!

08:39.080 --> 08:41.040
I hear there are lots of shops, too!

08:41.290 --> 08:42.710
Yay!

08:42.710 --> 08:43.790
Yippee!

08:44.080 --> 08:46.710
The girls should be fine here in town.

08:47.380 --> 08:51.830
Once I get paid for my crystals,
I think I'll head back to the woods.

08:52.920 --> 08:55.880
I'm terribly sorry, but this is all the money we have.

08:56.040 --> 08:57.670
Please let it be enough!

08:58.670 --> 09:01.130
Uhh, I'm not trying to rob you, here...

09:01.790 --> 09:05.290
My apologies. We aren't done
working through the haul you brought in.

09:05.920 --> 09:08.500
We don't have enough cash on hand, either.

09:08.880 --> 09:10.380
What do you say to payment in installments?

09:11.040 --> 09:13.000
Oh. Sure, that's fine.

09:13.250 --> 09:14.330
Hooray!

09:14.330 --> 09:15.630
"Hooray" nothing!

09:15.830 --> 09:19.750
Sorry 'bout this. Here's all we can do for now.

09:20.460 --> 09:21.790
Eight million Ereh.

09:24.880 --> 09:30.080
Uhh, if money's supposed to be worth
about the same as it was back home, then...

09:31.920 --> 09:32.630
<b>Got 8,000,000 Ereh!</b>

09:32.040 --> 09:34.040
Eight million?!

09:34.500 --> 09:36.540
Let me explain the current market!

09:36.790 --> 09:37.960
In your case,

09:37.960 --> 09:41.710
you brought in enough F Rank ones to earn eight million!

09:39.790 --> 09:43.830
<b>Calamity Level</b>

09:39.790 --> 09:43.830
<b>1 billion Ereh</b>

09:39.790 --> 09:43.830
<b>Defeating an entire nation</b>

09:39.790 --> 09:43.830
<b>100 million Ereh</b>

09:39.790 --> 09:43.830
<b>Impossible for most</b>

09:39.800 --> 09:43.830
<b>100 billion Ereh</b>

09:39.800 --> 09:43.830
<b>Legendary Level</b>

09:39.800 --> 09:43.830
<b>10 billion Ereh</b>

09:39.800 --> 09:43.830
<b>100 Ereh</b>

09:39.800 --> 09:43.830
<b>Everything else</b>

09:41.960 --> 09:43.630
Talk about a loose explanation!

09:43.880 --> 09:47.670
That also includes payment
for defeating the Green Wolves.

09:48.290 --> 09:49.920
Makes sense.

09:50.080 --> 09:52.920
This should be enough to do some shopping
before heading back to the woods.

09:53.790 --> 09:58.080
Let's all go out shopping for the things we need!

09:58.380 --> 09:59.790
Yay!

10:00.040 --> 10:03.580
Hey, kid, I know a certain place I think you'd like.

10:04.080 --> 10:05.330
Think of this as thanks.

10:05.670 --> 10:07.000
A place I'd like...?

10:07.500 --> 10:08.580
A place I'd like?!

10:08.580 --> 10:09.880
Welcome in~!

10:09.170 --> 10:11.290
Tell me you don't have your head in the gutter!

10:12.670 --> 10:14.420
H-hey, now!

10:15.460 --> 10:17.000
You're hair is so fine!

10:15.460 --> 10:17.000
There, there.

10:17.420 --> 10:20.670
Y-you sure? This early in the day?

10:21.880 --> 10:24.380
Here we are. This is the place.

10:25.290 --> 10:26.750
A little-known weapon shop.

10:26.750 --> 10:28.710
What good is this guy?!

10:29.040 --> 10:32.710
This place collects specialty articles from dungeons.

10:33.290 --> 10:36.420
The perfect shop for less ordinary sorts like yourself.

10:36.960 --> 10:41.790
Yeah, yeah. I'm a NEET, and a Loner,
and not one bit ordinary...

10:42.080 --> 10:45.040
I know it looks sketchy, but I promise the wares are legit.

10:45.460 --> 10:48.210
And despite his looks, the owner's a good guy.

10:48.210 --> 10:50.500
Thanks as always for the business!

10:50.670 --> 10:53.130
Can I try some of these out?

10:53.420 --> 10:54.960
Be my guest.

10:56.790 --> 10:58.000
<b>INVISIBILITY</b>

10:56.790 --> 10:58.000
<b>CLOAK</b>

10:56.790 --> 10:58.000
<b>MAKES WEARER HARDER TO DETECT</b>

10:59.330 --> 11:00.500
<b>POWER GLOVE</b>

11:00.830 --> 11:01.330
<b>FIRE MAGIC</b>

11:00.830 --> 11:03.000
<b>FIRE STAFF</b>

11:04.830 --> 11:06.000
<b>BLADE THAT GROWS SHARPER WITH MAGIC</b>

11:04.830 --> 11:06.000
<b>[REQUIRED LV: 50]</b>

11:04.840 --> 11:06.000
<b>MAGIC BLADE</b>

11:07.040 --> 11:09.250
Hard to say no to any of it!

11:09.920 --> 11:12.250
My first isekai shopping spree!

11:16.460 --> 11:19.460
<b>SEVEN NECKLACE</b>

11:17.630 --> 11:18.710
"Fits seven?"

11:18.210 --> 11:19.460
<b>FITS SEVEN</b>

11:19.540 --> 11:25.920
Now that I think of it, ever since my appraisal skill hit
level 5, my Villager A Set has had the same description.

11:27.130 --> 11:31.330
Hey, shopkeep, what does "fits seven"
mean with this necklace?

11:31.790 --> 11:34.710
That's referring to combining items.

11:34.960 --> 11:36.000
Combining them?

11:36.170 --> 11:46.540
<b>COMBINE!!</b>

11:36.170 --> 11:46.540
<b>NECKLACE</b>

11:36.170 --> 11:46.540
<b>PENDANT</b>

11:36.170 --> 11:46.540
<b>NECKLACE</b>

11:36.170 --> 11:46.540
<b>NECKLACE</b>

11:36.170 --> 11:46.540
<b>PENDANT</b>

11:36.170 --> 11:46.540
<b>NECKLACE</b>

11:36.170 --> 11:46.540
<b>PENDANT</b>

11:36.250 --> 11:38.330
With this necklace, you can combine

11:38.330 --> 11:44.330
up to seven items and use their effects all at once.

11:44.580 --> 11:46.170
Oh, that sounds useful!

11:46.580 --> 11:51.960
And if my Villager A Set can do the same, then...
I can add a bunch more effects to my equipment!

11:52.080 --> 11:53.880
I gotta buy myself some more!

11:53.880 --> 11:54.790
HEY!

11:55.420 --> 11:56.420
<b>WHISTLE</b>

11:56.830 --> 11:58.580
Do you know what time it is?!

11:58.830 --> 12:01.580
Great, reprimanded even in another world...

12:02.290 --> 12:05.460
It's time to go back! Everyone else is already asleep!

12:05.920 --> 12:09.580
J-just a bit longer! Just to get this Mistle Vine!

12:09.580 --> 12:11.580
<b>Mistle Vine</b>

12:09.580 --> 12:11.580
<b>Upgrades Wooden Stick to Staff</b>

12:11.580 --> 12:12.710
Bwah!

12:13.420 --> 12:14.460
No!

12:21.040 --> 12:23.380
I think I just combined all these items...

12:23.790 --> 12:25.000
What?!

12:25.330 --> 12:29.290
Th-that's not allowed!
Especially not before you purchase them!

12:29.290 --> 12:32.330
That was all worth well over 10 million Ereh!

12:32.630 --> 12:34.920
T-ten million?!

12:37.500 --> 12:40.330
Think you could knock that down a bit for my sake?

12:40.710 --> 12:43.880
Please! We only have 8 million!

12:44.420 --> 12:46.000
Now you apologize, too!

12:46.790 --> 12:50.000
No more shopping, then?!

12:54.000 --> 12:57.000
<b>DAY 20</b>

12:57.250 --> 13:01.750
I'm out of cash, and with so much more I wanted...

13:04.250 --> 13:09.460
We managed to talk him down to 8 million,
but that left us broke.

13:14.500 --> 13:16.960
I'd love to go out and earn more crystals,

13:17.210 --> 13:22.380
but outsiders aren't allowed out of town
unless they become adventurers and get a permit.

13:26.330 --> 13:28.960
Even if I try and sneak out with the girls,

13:28.960 --> 13:32.210
I'm sure I'd get stopped because
someone doesn't trust me anymore.

13:32.960 --> 13:35.500
What's a loner and a NEET supposed to do?

13:44.710 --> 13:47.000
I'm not built for a life in town.

13:47.880 --> 13:50.130
I gotta get back to the woods.

13:54.580 --> 13:58.710
My regular old Villager A Cape
is now combined with an Invisibility Cloak!

13:59.790 --> 14:02.920
Even the Class Rep won't spot me with this!

14:04.080 --> 14:07.040
Sneaky sneaky...

14:04.080 --> 14:06.290
Really?

14:06.290 --> 14:07.830
I wanna check it out!

14:07.250 --> 14:09.500
<b>Conceal</b>

14:07.250 --> 14:09.500
<b>Stealth</b>

14:07.960 --> 14:09.420
I feel bad leaving without saying anything...

14:08.540 --> 14:09.500
You should!

14:09.500 --> 14:10.750
I feel bad leaving without saying anything...

14:11.290 --> 14:12.920
But she'd only stop me if I did.

14:13.290 --> 14:14.080
Hmm?

14:24.790 --> 14:26.000
It worked!

14:33.040 --> 14:34.790
There's no one guarding over here!

14:34.790 --> 14:37.380
Just gotta hop over the walls!

14:38.170 --> 14:39.080
Where you off to?

14:46.380 --> 14:47.750
YEOWCH!

14:47.960 --> 14:53.500
What the heck, Volleyball Girls A & B
and Gymnast Girl!! Don't spook me like that!

14:53.500 --> 14:54.880
"What the heck?!" Yourself!

14:54.880 --> 14:56.580
We thought someone was sneaking around!

14:56.750 --> 15:00.080
These girls are like the Elite Four of the girl jocks...

15:00.830 --> 15:01.330
Hmm?

15:02.540 --> 15:04.330
One of them is missing...

15:04.710 --> 15:06.080
<b>Perception</b>

15:06.210 --> 15:08.830
That's the last one of the group...

15:09.960 --> 15:12.170
The Naturist Girl who looks
ready to strip any second now?!

15:12.500 --> 15:15.790
My gosh, all these clothes are so cute!

15:16.000 --> 15:17.000
You gotta be kidding!

15:17.210 --> 15:20.130
You can't go full naturist out here!

15:20.250 --> 15:23.960
Quit fussing. I'm still dressed!

15:25.670 --> 15:28.290
More like half-undressed!

15:28.420 --> 15:31.540
I'm wearing clothes, okay? Like I'm supposed to...

15:32.250 --> 15:34.040
Maybe I went too far.

15:34.630 --> 15:38.040
That outfit's cute! Bet it would look good on you.

15:38.330 --> 15:41.630
Y-you think so?! Would it?

15:41.630 --> 15:42.710
Mhmm!

15:43.130 --> 15:45.790
Escape Plan: Part 1, was a failure!

15:46.750 --> 15:47.710
<b>DAY 21</b>

15:47.710 --> 15:48.880
Okay, then.

15:49.210 --> 15:51.500
We're off on our first quest!

15:51.710 --> 15:53.830
Bye, now!

15:53.830 --> 15:56.040
Uhh, can I come?

15:56.040 --> 15:59.630
Absolutely not! You tried to run away yesterday!

15:59.960 --> 16:01.630
Yeah, but...

16:01.880 --> 16:04.210
Nope! Not happening!

16:04.380 --> 16:07.080
Fine. I'll just wait here.

16:07.460 --> 16:09.420
We'll be back before you know it.

16:19.960 --> 16:21.580
Sneaky sneaky...

16:25.000 --> 16:26.630
That's it!

16:26.880 --> 16:29.330
Escape Plan: Part 2, is a success!

16:30.040 --> 16:32.330
Shoulda done this from the start!

16:32.330 --> 16:34.000
Now I can get back to the forest!

16:39.210 --> 16:41.040
There used to be a village there...

16:41.170 --> 16:43.330
But I wanna get back to the woods, so whatever!

16:46.250 --> 16:48.420
Thought maybe I heard the nerds...

16:48.710 --> 16:50.830
But I wanna get back to the woods, so whatever!

16:53.170 --> 16:54.250
C'mon!

16:54.250 --> 16:55.750
We won't hurt ya!

16:56.000 --> 16:57.380
Come on out!

16:57.380 --> 17:00.960
No way. This is like THE isekai situation here...

17:01.330 --> 17:02.630
Help!

17:03.920 --> 17:05.630
Help!

17:07.290 --> 17:09.670
But I really wanna get back to the woods, so whatever!

17:09.880 --> 17:10.630
How could you?!

17:12.130 --> 17:13.460
Where you going?

17:13.830 --> 17:14.630
Sorry?

17:14.920 --> 17:16.830
All witnesses die!

17:17.000 --> 17:21.040
Uhh... I just wanna get to the woods, see...

17:21.040 --> 17:23.170
Wuzzat? You say something?

17:23.170 --> 17:25.580
Can't hear through all the mumbling!

17:25.580 --> 17:27.460
You got something to say?

17:27.710 --> 17:30.630
Fire Bullets!

17:31.460 --> 17:34.420
I just wanna get back to the woods!

17:34.420 --> 17:36.880
I just wanna be alone!

17:43.920 --> 17:49.210
Okay! This wooden staff or whatever my stick
got upgraded into packs a punch.

17:50.330 --> 17:52.540
Must be thanks to that Mistle Vine.

17:53.670 --> 17:57.670
I must have combined the Fire staff into it, too.

17:57.830 --> 17:59.790
Y-you little punk...

17:59.790 --> 18:02.330
What's up with his magic?

18:02.630 --> 18:05.750
Uhh, you might wanna call it quits.

18:06.040 --> 18:07.500
Shut your face, brat!

18:07.500 --> 18:09.250
This guy's got some magic job class!

18:09.250 --> 18:11.170
Take him in close combat!

18:15.580 --> 18:18.080
You sure he's got a magic job?

18:18.080 --> 18:19.670
Actually, I have no job...

18:19.670 --> 18:20.330
Huh?

18:20.710 --> 18:22.420
WHAAAAT?!

18:22.420 --> 18:27.210
ACK! Why'd I say that? How do I even explain myself?!

18:27.500 --> 18:29.880
The kid really has no job!

18:29.880 --> 18:31.960
He's just some level 9 shrimp.

18:31.960 --> 18:33.710
Use your weapon skills!

18:33.920 --> 18:36.130
If I remember, weapon skills are...

18:36.500 --> 18:38.540
Am I in trouble?

18:36.500 --> 18:40.210
<b>Available from Lv 20</b>

18:36.500 --> 18:40.210
<b>Weapon Skills</b>

18:36.500 --> 18:40.210
<b>Powerful attacks</b>

18:38.670 --> 18:39.750
You're going to die!

18:42.250 --> 18:43.290
Slash!

18:44.630 --> 18:45.960
So these are weapon skills!

18:48.880 --> 18:49.830
Double!

18:50.920 --> 18:56.000
Once they select their skills, their bodies
automatically move to unleash powerful attacks.

18:56.750 --> 18:58.000
Bash!

18:59.000 --> 19:00.500
They're strong, sure...

19:01.080 --> 19:02.790
Slash! Slash! Slash!

19:03.000 --> 19:04.960
Double! Double! Double! Double!

19:05.210 --> 19:07.000
Bash! Bash! Bash!

19:09.420 --> 19:11.460
But if they keep running their mouths like this...

19:17.250 --> 19:19.540
Of course they're gonna run out of breath and pass out.

19:20.920 --> 19:25.500
Their weapon skills were scary,
but these guys themselves are still pretty weak.

19:28.880 --> 19:32.000
I know not your circumstances,
but I offer you my gratitude.

19:34.500 --> 19:37.000
My name is Merielle. I come from a noble family.

19:37.460 --> 19:40.670
Thank you for defeating these bandits...

19:41.130 --> 19:43.000
Though they sort of beat themselves...

19:43.540 --> 19:46.040
Thanks for helping me by...

19:46.210 --> 19:48.170
What ever am I even supposed to say?

19:48.420 --> 19:50.580
And so I find yet another dimwit.

19:51.380 --> 19:53.880
You did try to ignore and abandon me at first...

19:54.790 --> 19:57.420
So perhaps thanking you is not appropriate?

19:58.290 --> 20:00.960
At the very least...you have my utmost appreciation!

20:01.710 --> 20:03.290
What's her deal?

20:03.290 --> 20:05.250
So, may I ask your name?

20:05.540 --> 20:07.380
It's Haruka.

20:07.630 --> 20:12.880
Sir Haruka, I am daughter to the Lord of a certain town.

20:13.250 --> 20:16.670
Might you accompany me on the remainder of my trip?

20:17.130 --> 20:18.380
Seriously...?

20:18.790 --> 20:21.920
All I want is to get back to being alone in the woods...

20:22.460 --> 20:24.830
After that attack, I fear for my safety.

20:25.210 --> 20:27.880
I would also like to show my gratitude.

20:28.210 --> 20:29.170
What kinda gratitude?!

20:30.290 --> 20:33.960
I guess it can't hurt to drop by and then leave right away.

20:34.460 --> 20:37.290
From where were you departing from, Sir Haruka?

20:38.130 --> 20:42.380
Oh, just some shabby town with extravagant inns.

20:42.380 --> 20:42.790
Hm?

20:43.380 --> 20:45.080
What was it called again?

20:45.790 --> 20:48.460
You might even say it wasn't worth a name anyway.

20:49.380 --> 20:54.380
The crystal exchange counter was slow,
the guild registration desk was unwelcoming,

20:54.380 --> 20:57.330
and they don't even let outsiders
back out without permits.

20:57.790 --> 21:01.540
The lord of a town like that is probably
as shabby as the town itself.

21:03.170 --> 21:04.380
Wait. What?

21:04.630 --> 21:09.380
My apologies. I am but the shabby daughter
of that shabby lord.

21:09.380 --> 21:10.170
What?!

21:10.420 --> 21:14.250
I am sorry to have acted so lofty
despite my lowly, nameless origins...

21:14.250 --> 21:16.710
Does that mean this carriage is headed for...

21:16.710 --> 21:18.750
Omui, of course.

21:18.750 --> 21:22.210
WHAT?! LET ME OUT! RIGHT NOW!

21:22.210 --> 21:25.290
I won't have it! You must first be treated well!

21:25.500 --> 21:27.750
I will prove to you our town is anything but shabby!

21:28.500 --> 21:31.830
<b>ESCAPE PLAN PART 2...  FAILED</b>

21:28.670 --> 21:31.380
Please, no!

21:47.920 --> 21:50.460
Outta the way, you stupid jocks.

21:50.790 --> 21:54.960
Not happening. We're not letting you get to the girls!

21:55.920 --> 21:59.000
Yeah? Well if that's how you want it...
